; A yearless 02/29 read in January 2029 means 2028/02/29, the most recent
; Feb 29 whose month is not ahead of today; 2029 has no Feb 29.

02/29 leap day
    Expenses:Food    $1
    Assets:Cash

test print --now 2029/01/15
2028/02/29 leap day
    Expenses:Food                                 $1
    Assets:Cash
end test
